apple-premium-6m-(in-store%2C-3-day-wait.important_instructions_raw:
This gift voucher is accepted exclusively at select Apple Premium Partner, Apple Premium Reseller and Mono Apple Authorised Reseller stores within India.
You can find your nearest store here.
The gift voucher can be used for eligible(all products excluding clearance sale &amp; open box devices) products available at Apple Premium Partner, Apple Premium Reseller and Apple Authorised Reseller stores for product purchases and cannot be used at service centres, App Store or any other online platforms.
There is no limit on the number of Gift Voucher or total value of Gift Vocuhers that a customer can redeem in a single invoice.
Customers can redeem the gift voucher at multiple stores in case of partial redemptions.
Customers wishing to avail Bank Cashback in store must meet the minimum card swipe amount as specified for the offer. Any remaining payable amount may be settled using Gift vouchers.
This gift voucher is valid for 6&nbsp;months from the date of issuance.&nbsp;
If a gift voucher gets blocked due to a technical issue, it will be usable only after 72 hours.&nbsp;
In case the order is canceled, the gift voucher amount will be refunded to the original gift card. Validity of the gift voucher will be based on the date of issuance not on date of usage or refund.&nbsp;
This Gift voucher cannot be redeemed for cash.
If the order value exceeds the cumulative balance in the gift voucher, the balance must be paid via another payment method available in the stores.
If the order value is less than the cumulative balance in the gift voucher, the remaining balance will remain in the gift card and can be used for future transactions until expiry.&nbsp;
Once the gift voucher has been issued, customers are responsible for protecting the gift card PIN and number. Apple, Apple Premium Resellers or its payment solution partners are not liable for any misuse due to loss of confidential details, and no refunds will be issued in such cases.&nbsp;
Apple Premium Resellers reserve the right to modify the terms and conditions of the gift voucher, including expiry and extensions.
For additional questions or further clarification, please refer to our Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs).

